*.env

# Secrets
*.pem
# Exception: retired pinned TLS cert for prod identity host (not a secret —
# public cert content). No longer used by the SDK at runtime (pinning was
# removed 2026-09-13, see CHANGELOG.md); kept here only as rollback evidence.
# See diagnostics/efghermesone-identity-pinned-cert.pem header.
!diagnostics/*.pem
diagnostics/
*.key
*.cert

# Build artifacts
*.whl
*.tar.gz
sbom*.json
sigstore/
